WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.240
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.260
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:10.290
Just a little more,

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.180
Just a little bit more,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.720
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:27.550
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:31.760
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.160 --> 00:00:36.490
You smiled at me,

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.520
Like a leaf swaying in the wind.

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:49.240
It seems as though my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:54.330
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:53.910 --> 00:00:57.020
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:59.160
Just a little more,

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:01.050
Just a little bit more,

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.970
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:09.620
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:12.820
And understand what I'm saying to you!

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.640
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:21.660
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:41.620
Class 2-A, gather round!

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:43.370
Okay!

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.830
Okay, it's almost time for Sports Day!

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:51.000
The winning class will receive a legendary golden headband!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:55.050
Everyone, make sure you don't get hurt, and do your best!

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:55.760
Yes!

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.930
Okay, Amamiya-san.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:01:59.590
You have something to tell everyone.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:01.890
You mean me?

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:02.970
Come on, Sayuri.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:04.930
Everyone's waiting.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.060
Come on!

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.600
Oh, Yuuka.

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:17.610
I'm assisting the administration this year, so I won't be able to participate in many events.

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:23.660
Please do your best so that we can win this year.

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.040
All right.

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:30.710
I've gotta do my best too!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:39.880
Inukai-kun?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.480
On your marks.

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:51.810
Get set.

00:02:52.010 --> 00:02:57.010
An Exciting Accident

00:02:55.730 --> 00:02:58.070
O-S! O-S!

00:02:58.070 --> 00:03:00.400
O-S! O-S!

00:02:58.750 --> 00:02:59.180
55th Annual Tsunugino High School Sports Day

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.410
Take this!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.620
Fight!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.120
Yay!!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.330
Go for it!

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.170
Go for it!

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:18.130
We did it!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:28.310
Oh my! Everyone's so passionate about it this year.

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:30.690
As the headmaster, I...

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:31.230
Matsuoka-sensei.

00:03:31.480 --> 00:03:32.560
What's the next event?

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.520
It's the boys' Swedish Relay.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:38.230
Oh, I'm good at that.

00:03:38.690 --> 00:03:40.530
People call me...

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.530
They're getting ready for it, right?

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.330
Yes. I don't think they'll have any problems.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.240
I see.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.540
Then there's no problem.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.920
I'm... I'm...

00:03:53.420 --> 00:03:54.380
Headmaster.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:56.630
There we go.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:04:00.720
Is everyone doing their best?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.890
I'll show them the results of my training!

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.260
On your marks.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.100
Get set.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.860
All right! Keep it up!

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.610
Now Class A will win!

00:04:20.610 --> 00:04:22.070
I did it!

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.370
You only have to run for 50 meters.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.790
No one will overtake me!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.920
Honestly. What are they doing?

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:46.340
In that case, I have a nutritious drink for them.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:48.930
I-It's all right.

00:04:50.010 --> 00:04:53.140
If you need it, call me anytime.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:55.310
Yes.

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.410
It's just getting started, everyone.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:10.330
Geez! What's with that result?

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.250
Do you really want to do this?

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:14.540
We're sorry.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.750
Look at this.

00:05:16.410 --> 00:05:17.370
Interclass Relay

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:20.040
At this rate, we won't be able to win.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.880
I'm sorry, everyone.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.340
If only we weren't injured.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:29.760
We're sore from all that running.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.390
You two can set things up by yourselves.

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:37.690
Sakura. Yuuka.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.270
Yes!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:40.980
Icchi.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.530
Yuusuke.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.240
That's it! Suffer!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.400
Impudent fools!

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:47.820
It'll be fine!

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.280
We'll catch up!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.450
Yeah!

00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:51.830
Now, what's next?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.790
We will now have a special Student Council Event.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:02.090
Each class needs to nominate a student, and send him to their headquarters.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:03.420
I repeat.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.090
Is that in the schedule?

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.470
I don't think so...

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:09.090
You're our representative, Aoba-kun.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.720
M-Me?!

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.220
You've been useless so far, so go do something useful.

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.690
Hey.

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:19.100
We're sorry, Riku-kun.

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.860
We're begging you.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:28.650
Hey. Hey!

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.990
What's going on here?!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:36.370
Now we'll have a match between these men!

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:41.040
These demons were secretly selected from among the participants.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.630
If they can catch Aoba-kun, the demon from Class 2-A, they win.

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.720
But if he can run away for three minutes, Aoba-kun will win.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.930
I-I'm trapped.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.140
I'm doomed.

00:06:52.470 --> 00:06:56.310
The winning class will receive 300 points!

00:06:56.770 --> 00:06:59.480
Now give it your all!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:04.860
Hey!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.110
Sakurai-kun!

00:07:12.950 --> 00:07:18.700
How did this happen?!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:20.580
It can't be!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:21.620
Impossible!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.840
He escaped from our macho teamwork!

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:27.090
He's so agile.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.180
I thought I was gonna die.

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:33.510
Well done, Aoba-kun!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:38.140
Your class gets 300 points!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.850
He did it!

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.980
Now we can't lose.

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.320
All right. Let's do our best.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:46.900
Yeah.

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:11.630
Oh, I didn't expect our class to win.

00:08:11.630 --> 00:08:13.880
This is all thanks to Aoba-kun.

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.220
You're exaggerating.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.970
You don't have to be shy.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:19.560
It's the truth.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.100
Amamiya-san!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.110
You did very well, Aoba-kun.

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:29.320
I'm relieved.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:31.820
Oh, well...

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.280
The other boys are hopeless compared to him.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:45.080
Say, Aoba-kun, will you enter the three-legged race with me this afternoon?

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:47.540
Good idea!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:50.210
You're our secret weapons!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:51.710
That's right.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.760
If I can be of use...

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.010
Okay!

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:56.220
Then it's decided!

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:59.050
I'll be cheering for you, so do your best.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:01.020
O-Okay.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.730
Riku!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.190
Tsukasa.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:06.560
Where did you come from?

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.190
I saw you as the demon.

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.770
You were so cool!

00:09:09.770 --> 00:09:11.650
I love you even more now!

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:14.030
What's with this all of a sudden, Kasuga-san?

00:09:14.570 --> 00:09:15.490
Oh yeah.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.660
To be honest...

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.580
Tada!

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:24.960
I made a lovely lunch for you!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.500
I worked hard on this for you.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:31.800
C'mon, eat up!

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:34.470
I'm so touched.

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.380
Thank you, Kasuga-san.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.260
Well then, I'll start.

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.550
What could this be?

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:42.770
You're...

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.130
Don't be fooled!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.390
H-Hiyoko-kun!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:48.190
You're being rude!

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.690
Well, let's see how much she's improved!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:56.900
Shiina-san?

00:09:57.820 --> 00:09:59.200
Shiina-san!

00:10:00.280 --> 00:10:03.660
Let's take her to Kosuga-sensei!

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:09.000
Huh? I skipped some of Harinui's classes, so did I get worse?

00:10:11.840 --> 00:10:13.750
Will Shiina-san be all right?

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.460
Life should be cherished.

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:22.100
What'll we do about the three-legged race?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:24.770
Yeah. We're in trouble.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:31.480
I'm Amamiya Sayuri. Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:32.820 --> 00:10:36.530
I'm Yoshino Tsubaki. Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.130
Isn't Shiina-san back yet?

00:10:52.420 --> 00:10:53.170
This isn't good.

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.500
This won't do.

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.130
Aoba-kun.

00:10:59.130 --> 00:11:00.340
I'll run in Shiina-san's place.

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.340
Amamiya-san?

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.060
Aren't you busy helping the administration?

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.350
I told them about this, and they gave me some time off.

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.520
Let's work hard for Ayame.

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:15.070
But...

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:15.770
All done.

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:17.780
Amamiya-san?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:19.780
Don't you want to run with me?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:21.740
On your mark.

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:23.990
Come on. Let's go, Aoba-kun.

00:11:24.320 --> 00:11:24.830
Okay.

00:11:25.530 --> 00:11:26.450
Get set.

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:29.120
Aoba! Ayame!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.870
We're counting on you!

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.500
Do your best!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.540
Isn't that Amamiya-san?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:49.180
One, two! One, two!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.230
Calm down, Aoba Riku!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.730
Aoba-kun! Get the envelope!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.110
They're running a treasure hunt race. They need to get the item written on a piece of paper and bring that to the finish line. Paper says: Get a silver accessory. Rarity: 5/8.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:00.780
A silver accessory?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:02.950
Who would have one?

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:12.160
Inukai-kun!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:15.670
Inukai-kun.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.630
What do you guys want?

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.800
We're in the treasure hunt race.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:24.720
We need to borrow your pendant.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.090
You mean this?

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.730
I have no reason to lend it to you.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.730
But our class could win...

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.270
That has nothing to do with me.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.690
Aoba-kun, let's ask someone else.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:43.450
Come on.

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:44.110
But...

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.950
Inukai-kun, please!

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.570
I told you to shut up!

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:48.660
But...

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:53.830
My foot...

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.210
Are you all right, Amamiya-san?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:58.590
Amamiya-san!

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:02.510
Amamiya-san!

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:07.800
Geez. I'll never forgive Inukai!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:10.470
Are you all right, Sayuri?

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.180
I'm fine.

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:15.560
Hoshino-sensei took good care of it.

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:17.100
It's all my fault.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.110
I'm sorry.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:21.820
Don't worry about it. It's not your fault, Aoba-kun.

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:25.200
But now we won't be able to participate in the relay.

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:26.410
What'll we do?

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:29.660
I'll be able to run if I take a short break.

00:13:30.530 --> 00:13:33.160
If our Amamiya-san can't run...

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:35.370
It would be a horrific loss to mankind!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:38.080
Don't say that.

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.050
But we have to handle the administrative duties.

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:43.510
Y-Yes.

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:46.680
In that case...

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:49.970
Exit Gate

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:48.680
Hey, Aoba!

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:50.100
Carry this!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.260
Yes!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.970
Bring the tape!

00:13:53.970 --> 00:13:55.020
Y-Yes!

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.140
Someone got hurt!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.600
Yes, yes, yes!

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.940
Call Hoshino-sensei!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:02.360
Buy three juices while you're at it!

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:04.740
All right!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.490
I didn't think it'd be so tough.

00:14:10.490 --> 00:14:15.950
Does the juice have anything to do with managing Sports Day?

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.630
Good work, Aoba-kun.

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:21.540
Please drink this.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:23.710
A-Amamiya-san!

00:14:24.460 --> 00:14:26.840
Don't scare me like that, Amamiya-san.

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.760
I thought that you'd be tired.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.260
Here you go.

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:33.470
T-Thanks.

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.470
I'm sorry, Aoba-kun.

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:36.980
You had to take my place.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:39.440
I'm fine.

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:42.610
I chose to take your place.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:47.400
Aoba-kun...

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.450
Well, there are just a few more administrative duties for us to do.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.120
I just have to try a bit harder!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.000
Yes. I'll be able to help soon.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:14:59.660
Aoba!

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:00.370
Yes, yes!

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:01.500
Aoba!

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.250
Yes! Yes!

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:05.750
Aoba's such a great guy!

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:08.300
We're so sorry, Aoba.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.010
We couldn't do anything.

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.320
All we have to do is bring this to them.

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:30.070
But it's amazing that they're going to use such a huge ball.

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:32.570
We'll manage.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.370
Come on. Let's hurry.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.280
Hey, wait, Amamiya-san!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.160
Aoba-kun!

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.830
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:44.330
Are you all right, Aoba-kun?

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.000
Yeah. I just fell down.

00:15:47.550 --> 00:15:48.920
How do you feel? Can you stand?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.050
I'm fine.

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:50.670
This is nothing.

00:15:51.430 --> 00:15:53.050
I see. Thank goodness.

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:02.980
Ah, found it!

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:05.400
That Aoba's hopeless.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:07.070
Why'd he leave it out here?

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:09.780
Who cares? Let's just bring it.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.530
The next event's gonna start.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:12.030
Yeah.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:20.950
How?!

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.670
How did this happen?!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:30.300
Go!

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:31.260
Push!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.550
All that's left is the relay.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:35.760
Just a little more.

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.800
By the way, where are Aoba and Amamiya?

00:16:38.180 --> 00:16:40.520
Aren't they with their classmates?

00:16:42.180 --> 00:16:42.930
Hey!

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.600
Someone open up!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.650
Anyone! Open up!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.530
They're pretty excited.

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:53.280
Yeah.

00:16:53.650 --> 00:16:55.160
It's almost time for the relay.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:56.280
I think so.

00:16:56.660 --> 00:16:57.740
I'm sure that no one realizes it.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.750
They're all caught up in the events.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:04.580
It'll be all right!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:08.000
Everyone's worried about you, so they should be looking for us.

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.000
Are they worried?

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:15.090
Why would they worry about me?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:22.720
At this rate, we'll end up missing the relay.

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:26.730
Yeah.

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:32.190
It's my first time missing an activity without telling anyone.

00:17:38.950 --> 00:17:39.490
I'm sorry.

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:42.620
I'm sorry, Amamiya-san.

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:47.580
If I hadn't been so excited about the three-legged race, this wouldn't have happened.

00:17:48.330 --> 00:17:51.170
Like I said, that wasn't your fault.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.760
Well, I've just transferred here.

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:57.720
I don't have many memories about school.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:03.390
So I should know how important memories are.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:08.810
And yet, because of me, one of your memories was destroyed.

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:10.440
Aoba-kun.

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:14.070
Geez. I told you before, right?

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:18.610
It's the first time I've missed an activity without telling anyone.

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:24.160
I did many things for the first time today.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:30.670
I missed the relay for the first time, and I got locked in here with a boy for the first time.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:36.050
So I'm never going to forget what I did today.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.010
For all sorts of reasons.

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:41.430
Thank you, Aoba-kun.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:44.470
You've given me some splendid memories.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.730
But they aren't very good memories.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:52.190
But I'll never forget them.

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.110
Right?

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.440
I'll never forget them either!

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:56.650
Never!

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:02.200
Because these are memories that only we share, right?

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:03.830
Yes.

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:04.660
Okay.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:09.120
Now it's time for you to tell me your story.

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:15.670
Where you've lived up until now, and which schools you've been to.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:17.840
Well, um...

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:22.930
Before I came here, I lived in a harbor in the northeast, and there was a lot of snow...

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.060
So, did you find them?

00:19:28.270 --> 00:19:30.060
No. We didn't see them anywhere.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:35.110
Where did Aoba-kun and Sayuri go?

00:19:36.110 --> 00:19:38.860
At this rate, we'll have to pull out of the relay.

00:19:39.570 --> 00:19:41.530
Oh, geez!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:45.330
Where are they hiding?

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:46.530
Damn it!

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:48.660
Move! Move!

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.170
I've got to go look for Riku-kun!

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:55.540
In this situation, we've got to do whatever it takes!

00:19:56.040 --> 00:19:57.800
N-No way, Icchi.

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.130
You don't mean Yagen-sensei?

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.680
If we don't stand up, we can't call ourselves men!

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:03.010
Icchi...

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:07.810
D-Doujima!

00:20:08.010 --> 00:20:08.930
Why are you...

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:12.890
I'll do it!

00:20:13.600 --> 00:20:17.650
We'll run in the relay in Aoba's place!

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:26.620
So I transferred between eight schools when I was in primary school.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.410
All you've done is transfer, right?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:30.540
Yeah.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.630
What was that?

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.290
Are all the events over?

00:20:44.550 --> 00:20:45.640
I-It opened.

00:20:46.640 --> 00:20:48.140
I wonder who opened it for us.

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:55.310
Could it be...

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:56.940
Hey, Aoba-kun!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:58.020
Look at that!

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:16.420
Class 2-A won the final event, and wins first place overall!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:18.380
Aoba...

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.340
We...

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.340
D-Did it!!!

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:25.130
You did it!

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:26.760
Congratulations, everyone!

00:21:27.010 --> 00:21:34.640
I just added sugar to the water, but if they believe in it, they can display incredible power.

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:39.690
I wonder what happened here.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:41.440
Y-Yeah.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.860
But I didn't expect our class to win.

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:47.820
Now we've got another memory.

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:51.660
That's true, too.

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:52.990
Isn't it?

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:37.210
When the morning sunlight streams through the window,

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:42.250
I immediately think of you.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:54.220
Our love began at first sight.

00:22:55.140 --> 00:23:00.230
We have a bright future!

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:06.650
Because you are my destined man!

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:17.330
I've always been searching for the feeling which broke my smile.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.340
I have grasped a piece of the miracle which fell into this world

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:30.260
I will run toward you, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.930
When we are together, we can overcome any obstacle!

00:23:35.510 --> 00:23:42.560
Our love is still young, but it's my treasure!

00:23:51.240 --> 00:23:52.320
Oh, it's raining.

00:23:52.820 --> 00:23:55.120
And I didn't bring an umbrella.

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.620
Can't you go home, Outama-san?

00:23:57.950 --> 00:23:59.580
I'd get wet, wouldn't I?

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.370
I've never gotten wet before.

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:00.500
Next Episode Preview

00:24:00.130 --> 00:24:00.500
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:09.340
It seems like the rain avoids me, so it doesn't rain around me.

00:24:10.170 --> 00:24:14.230
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial Only Love: An Exciting Rain.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:15.540
Please watch it.

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:18.900
Isn't that an occult thing, not a legend?

00:24:23.310 --> 00:24:26.320
The Exciting Rain
